      "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:15:47.934Z",
      "cooked": "<p>System: v15 hosted by frappe + Plaid + MINT.</p>\n<p>When trying to reconcile a credit card payment from bank account as ‘Transfer’, MINT successfully suggests a mirrored transaction, but when I click “Accept”, and then click Transfer”, an error message pops up:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>There was an error.</strong></p>\n<p>Error: Value missing for Payment Entry: Payment Form</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/9/49104e490e560f24b06341f66c3bd51f9f16ecf5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/49104e490e560f24b06341f66c3bd51f9f16ecf5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/9/49104e490e560f24b06341f66c3bd51f9f16ecf5_2_561x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"aqlN09CSbqLJspGNbvmEaXB4sdf\" width=\"561\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/9/49104e490e560f24b06341f66c3bd51f9f16ecf5_2_561x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/9/49104e490e560f24b06341f66c3bd51f9f16ecf5_2_841x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/9/49104e490e560f24b06341f66c3bd51f9f16ecf5.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F1EEEE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">859×765 94.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>There are no other values / fields on this form so no immediate clue where the issue is coming from.</p>\n<p>I will appreciate any direction to get this solved.</p>\n<p>Thank you in advance!</p>",
