      "id": 489184,
      "username": "AGS",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:48:02.485Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Looking into the default Payment Entry under Accounts Payable shows there is a pull-down field called “Payment Form” which refers to the type of payment (03 = electronic transfer). The issue likely is related to MINT not specifying this field during reconciliation of transfer.</p>\n<p>This may be a bug?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79c1f55ceb493280b985ff81cf83d65d32b43de5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/79c1f55ceb493280b985ff81cf83d65d32b43de5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79c1f55ceb493280b985ff81cf83d65d32b43de5_2_690x413.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hn7kkM0gVCnUKt8z3ZYd31vcHqZ\" width=\"690\" height=\"413\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79c1f55ceb493280b985ff81cf83d65d32b43de5_2_690x413.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79c1f55ceb493280b985ff81cf83d65d32b43de5_2_1035x619.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79c1f55ceb493280b985ff81cf83d65d32b43de5.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1312×786 54.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
